# ── jolarca-dev policy-mandated patterns ─────────────────────────────────────
# policy/repo-defaults.yml#data_handling.required_gitignore_patterns — keys,
# certs, credentials and Terraform state must never enter history. Verified
# absent by the readiness gate on 2026-09-28 (finding L-14).
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
secrets.json
credentials.json
.env.*
!.env.example
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/

# Tool caches (finding A-04: .ruff_cache/ existed on disk and was NOT ignored,
# so it would have been committed — the D-28 failure class).
.ruff_cache/
